            "msg_id": "M20",
            "speaker_id": 81248,
            "reply_to": "M19",
            "text": "This is a great start, thanks for taking the lead. The templates look solid. On A4, let's add a specific requirement for a screenshot of the system transaction for any manual adjustments over a certain threshold. It will help the auditors trace things back.",
