          {
            "msg_id": "M51",
            "speaker_id": 523876,
            "reply_to": null,
            "text": "Team, the trial run of the new close checklist on last month's data is complete (T10). Overall, the process felt smoother. Total time was 6.5 days. I've logged detailed notes and timings in the Compliance Review and Findings Log (A8), but the main issue was a delay in getting expense reports approved on Day 3.",
            "mentions": [
              81248,
              16157,
              375245,
              457591
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "T10",
              "A8"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M52",
            "speaker_id": 81248,
            "reply_to": "M51",
            "text": "Thanks for running this and for the clear summary. A half-day buffer is good, but we can improve. The expense report issue is a recurring theme. We need to make the pre-close communication to department heads more explicit about that cut-off. Let's add a specific line item to the checklist A1 for this.",
            "mentions": [
              523876
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A1"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": [
              {
                "emoji": "lightbulb",
                "count": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M53",
            "speaker_id": 375245,
            "reply_to": "M51",
            "text": "I agree, the flow was better. One thing I noticed is that the peer review for revenue recognition entries took longer than planned. The criteria in the checklist might be too broad. Maybe we can refine it to focus only on non-standard contracts?",
